WEBVTT

00:06:28.843 --> 00:06:31.804
If governments aren't collecting
information on suicide rates

00:06:31.846 --> 00:06:33.055
and homelessness,

00:06:33.055 --> 00:06:35.141
then they can argue
that if there's no data,

00:06:35.182 --> 00:06:36.350
there's no issue.

00:06:36.392 --> 00:06:38.727
Regardless of how often
these laws are applied,

00:06:38.727 --> 00:06:41.313
they have contributed
to the lack of information

00:06:41.313 --> 00:06:45.401
on how many queer people are barred
from accessing lifesaving services,

00:06:45.443 --> 00:06:49.989
spanning education, health,
legal assistance programs and more.

00:06:50.406 --> 00:06:52.658
But imagine for a moment
if you could do this

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:55.828
in a way that allows us
to own our own data

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.581
in a secure, encrypted
and consensual manner

00:06:58.622 --> 00:07:00.249
that is not extractive.